{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29937","headline":"句 · 潘咸","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栈踏猨声暮，江看剑影秋。\n僧老白云上，磬寒高鸟边。\n心已同猨狖，不闻人是非。\n行人渡流水，白马入前山。\n秋深雪满黄金塞，夜夜鸿声入汉阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"潘咸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}